Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Could you stop the camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:10.34,Default,Cameraman,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:12.49,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Do it right now, or I'll break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:14.05,Default,Cameraman,0000,0000,0000,,U-Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:34.18,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Sung. What do you \Nintend to do to Byung-gu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:38.07,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,I asked you a question!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.07,0:00:40.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,We're running out of time. \NPlease stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:44.83,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.08,0:02:37.14,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,The chairman has called for the \Nexecution of plan 9. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:38.79,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0000,0000,0000,,Are you insane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:43.23,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0000,0000,0000,,You wanna send us back to the island \Nwhile that monster is still there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:46.14,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0000,0000,0000,,You'd be singing a different tune \Nif you'd seen it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:48.69,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0000,0000,0000,,Goto died... like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:51.27,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,The new variant is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:54.13,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,One of their hunters took it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:57.28,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0000,0000,0000,,It's... dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:03:00.21,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,Do you still insist on staying behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:06.60,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,A skill that lets you use \Nthe powers of the dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:09.46,Default,Ma Dongwook,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't just summoning magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:11.01,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Byung-gu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:15.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I heard a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:21.07,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,It was Hunter Min, asking me to use his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:36.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I think I can tell what he was like in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:41.38,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,To immediately go and heal Hunter Cha \Nwithout even being given the order...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,He must've been a kind, caring person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:48.81,DefaultItalics,Cameraman,0000,0000,0000,,I can see why he wouldn't \Nwant this getting out on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:52.86,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,The ability to grow stronger and stronger \Nas he engages in more difficult battles...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.24,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,What a monstrous ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:57.26,DefaultItalics,Ma Dongwook,0000,0000,0000,,But with Min...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:59.36,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:03.12,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,If you intend to continue battling as a hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.12,0:04:05.74,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Byung-gu's power \Nwill be of great use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:09.20,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,But... He always hated fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:17.23,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,I would rather he not have \Nto return to the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:20.11,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,This takes me back to the red gate incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:23.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,You grabbed my shoulder then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:28.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,But this time, instead of giving an order, \Nyou're making an earnest plea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:31.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:38.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Release extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:03.69,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:07.12,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0000,0000,0000,,How are they alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:10.60,DefaultItalics,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,After a rendezvous with Hunter Sung, \Nhe proceeded to defeat the new variant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.14,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0000,0000,0000,,I can see that, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:13.89,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0000,0000,0000,,How is he on the island?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.89,0:05:16.84,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0000,0000,0000,,I thought he wasn't participating in the raid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.04,DefaultItalics,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:21.38,DefaultItalics,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,From the magic power readings, \Nall we can say is he appeared out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:26.90,DefaultItalics,Matsumoto Shigeo,0000,0000,0000,,This is a nightmare. And after we lost \Nseven of our ten S-Rank hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:31.23,DefaultItalics,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,Chairman, should we proceed with plan 9?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:36.89,DefaultItalics,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,Any further casualties will undercut \Nour ability to respond to domestic gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.89,0:05:40.52,DefaultItalics,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,to say nothing about \Nthe global balance of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:41.65,DefaultItalics,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,What's your call?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:46.20,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0000,0000,0000,,We're pulling out. Withdraw immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:47.93,DefaultItalics,Sugimoto Reiji,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:06.64,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,Why have the ants started \Ncoming at us so suddenly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:10.41,Default,Gina,0000,0000,0000,,How should we know?! \NI thought the queen was dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.41,0:06:11.53,Default,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,That's probably why!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:15.73,Default,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,With their leader gone, they're running amok!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:18.06,Default,Park Heejin,0000,0000,0000,,We can't let them reach the mainland!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:20.09,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,They ain't gettin' past us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:22.40,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Time to show these bugs \Nwhat the Knights Guild can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:23.84,Default,Jung Yoontae,0000,0000,0000,,You got it, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:29.09,Default,Shin Seokjin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:36.60,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this is a real shitshow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:40.11,Default,Seo Jiwoo,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like the ants trying to flee \Nthe island are spreading out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.11,0:06:41.60,Default,Seo Jiwoo,0000,0000,0000,,and heading toward the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.98,Default,Seo Jiwoo,0000,0000,0000,,We have to hurry before \Nthey cut off our route back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.98,0:06:47.38,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,We should take off at once. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:48.98,Default,Jung Yoontae,0000,0000,0000,,What about Hunter Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:52.60,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0000,0000,0000,,He's staying behind to take care \Nof the remaining ants and eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:56.94,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I hate to admit it, but in our condition, \Nwe'd only slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:07:00.28,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,And though she's no longer in mortal danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:03.65,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,it'd be better to have the medic team \Nexamine Hunter Cha as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.73,0:07:16.22,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Getting experience from smashing \Nunhatched eggs is a nice surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I almost feel bad for not \Nusing this thing more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:38.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,The Demon Monarch's Sword \Nsure does live up to its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:41.62,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,That said... I'll leave the rest to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:59.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I've finally hit level 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:07.72,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,He's still emitting a ton of aura, \Neven after dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:10.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:21.76,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,What is this darkness? I can't sense anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen during the extraction?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.45,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,For a second there, I thought it had failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:05.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Well, on to the other ants...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:06.66,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,My king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:10.72,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Did you just talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:11.80,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:15.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,None of the other shadows \Ncould talk... So why can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:20.22,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,My king, I ask that you grant me a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.05,0:09:24.18,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,"General" rank? Never seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:27.07,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Is the new rank why he can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.27,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,And I've gotta wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:34.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I was the one who killed you. \NAre you still willing to obey me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:38.60,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,I did not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:42.41,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,By your hand, I was reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:46.63,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,I am filled with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:50.44,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,I swear to serve you for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:54.60,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,Please grant me a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:58.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Beru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:02.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Your name is Beru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:05.25,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,I am honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:07.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Now, back to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.43,0:10:09.50,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:16.23,Default,Mob Hunters,0000,0000,0000,,They got past the hunters at sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:19.53,Default,Vice Guildmaster,0000,0000,0000,,We're the last line of defense! \NWe cannot let them reach the cities!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.53,0:10:21.14,Default,Lee Minsung,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:23.47,Default,Lee Minsung,0000,0000,0000,,How the hell do we fight these things?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:24.75,Default,Reaper Mob,0000,0000,0000,,Tanks, get in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:26.65,Default,Reaper Mob,0000,0000,0000,,We hold the line, or we die trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:32.53,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,That's a lot of ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:38.89,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,Four thousand without a leader. \NThey appear to be fleeing in all directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.89,0:10:40.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,There were still that many?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:42.95,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Can you thin out the numbers for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:45.98,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,If that is your wish, my king, then certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:47.43,Default,Beru,0000,0000,0000,,You need only say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:49.34,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:11:00.45,Default,Song Chiyul,0000,0000,0000,,Good! Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:04.32,Default,Song Chiyul,0000,0000,0000,,These things are dangerous, \Nso be careful and take one down at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:07.02,Default,Song Chiyul,0000,0000,0000,,Work together, and make sure—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:07.03,Default,Lee Joohee,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Song!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:14.67,Default,Lee Joohee,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Mr. Song?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:16.45,Default,Song Chiyul,0000,0000,0000,,What just happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:23.04,Default,Lee Joohee,0000,0000,0000,,What was that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:27.58,Default,Song Chiyul,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. But I think it saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:30.17,Default,Lee Joohee,0000,0000,0000,,Jinwoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.51,0:11:34.59,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0000,0000,0000,,There's just too damn many!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.21,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:38.07,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Not without wrecking the helicopter, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:43.83,Default,Ma Dongwook,0000,0000,0000,,I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:46.06,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,There's not a lot we can do in midair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:07.39,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, he saved us once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:13.85,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,They should be able to make it back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:20.32,Narration,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Afterward, the majority of the ants \Nthat had dispersed from the island
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:24.94,Narration,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,were held off by the many hunters in the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:28.99,Narration,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,minimizing the damage to the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:32.20,Narration,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Our country's S-Rank hunters returned safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:37.85,Narration,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Cha, who remained unconscious, \Nwas transported to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:42.50,Narration,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,It was a battle with many casualties,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:48.26,Narration,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,but the emergent threat from the island \Nwas successfully dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.11,0:12:54.54,Narration,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,And so, the fourth Jeju Island raid \Nended in our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.19,0:13:02.65,Default,Commander,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we've got more \Nvisitors from far abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:05.10,Default,Commander,0000,0000,0000,,It's been two days of this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.06,Default,Crew,0000,0000,0000,,They'll be within firing range shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:09.31,Default,Vice Commander,0000,0000,0000,,Notify the mage-type hunters on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.31,0:13:10.46,Default,Vice Commander,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:11.37,Default,Commander,0000,0000,0000,,No, belay that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:15.28,Default,Commander,0000,0000,0000,,Our country's hero \Nseems to want a bit of exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:17.87,Default,Liu Zhigang,0000,0000,0000,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:21.38,Default,Liu Zhigang,0000,0000,0000,,Can't just sit around all day, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:24.70,Default,Liu Zhigang,0000,0000,0000,,Let's send every last one of them \Nto a watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:44.98,Default,Liu Zhigang,0000,0000,0000,,If I'd gotten a crack at the black ant \Ninstead of these peons,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:47.69,Default,Liu Zhigang,0000,0000,0000,,I might've actually had some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:49.53,Default,Liu Zhigang,0000,0000,0000,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:52.24,DefaultItalics,Announcer,0000,0000,0000,,It's now been several days \Nsince the raid ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.77,0:13:55.70,DefaultItalics,Announcer,0000,0000,0000,,A memorial has been erected \Nto honor the victims,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:58.62,DefaultItalics,Announcer,0000,0000,0000,,and a large crowd has \Ncome to pay their respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:05.25,DefaultItalics,Announcer,0000,0000,0000,,Here we have the S-Rank hunter, \NSung Jinwoo, approaching the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:08.93,DefaultItalics,Announcer,0000,0000,0000,,He contributed a great deal to this raid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:12.41,DefaultItalics,Announcer,0000,0000,0000,,with some saying that it would not have been \Na success without his participation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.18,DefaultItalicsTop,Announcer,0000,0000,0000,,Some are calling him a hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:17.13,DefaultItalics,Announcer B,0000,0000,0000,,But at the same time, many are \Nquestioning whether or not
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:20.60,DefaultItalics,Announcer B,0000,0000,0000,,there would have been fewer casualties \Nhad he participated from the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.60,0:14:22.60,DefaultItalics,Announcer B,0000,0000,0000,,to sum up some of the more critical voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:30.25,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,Please hold your head high.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:36.63,Default,Baek Yoonho,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what the public thinks, you're \Nthe one who put an end to this tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:55.66,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,As chairman of the Hunter's Association, \NI'd like to first thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:59.60,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,for your service during \Nthe fourth Jeju Island raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:06.19,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,No... If I had got there sooner, \Nmaybe Hunter Min could have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.69,0:15:13.60,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,But thanks to you, the other five S-Ranks and \Nmany of our countrymen's lives were saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:15.53,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,That is a major accomplishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:21.07,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I promise that you will be rewarded \Nhowever you wish in due time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.68,0:15:22.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:28.86,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Now, I was wondering what \Nyour plans are for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:30.83,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,The future, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:31.98,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:37.35,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,This raid resulted in your power being \Ndemonstrated on an international level.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:40.14,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt the public will leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:42.82,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,There will be many who will \Ntry to approach you, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:46.36,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,The Association can't ignore that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:51.15,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Which is why I feel the need \Nto ask you, Hunter Sung...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:56.81,Default,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,What do you intend to do \Nwith your great power, and where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:05.27,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thinking about starting my own guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:10.65,Default,Jung Yoontae,0000,0000,0000,,How the hell didya end up \Nstuck on cleanup duty
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:13.13,Default,Jung Yoontae,0000,0000,0000,,instead of attendin' the \Nmemorial service, Master?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:16.60,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, dumbass. Makin' sure the \Nenemies're dead, killin' stragglers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:19.46,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,and collectin' resources is all important stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.46,0:16:23.55,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Bein' entrusted with the last bits \Nof a job is a sign they trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:24.31,Default,Jung Yoontae,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:25.85,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:34.44,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,A real man does the job he's given, \Nnice and steady, without no bitchin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:36.36,Default,Jung Yoontae,0000,0000,0000,,You're so awesome, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:42.25,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Who the hell're you?! \NThis place is off-limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:43.85,DefaultTop,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:48.15,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:51.19,Default,Park Jongsoo,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno who you are, \Nbut yer not supposed—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:57.00,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:59.33,Default,Old Man,0000,0000,0000,,All the noise they were making \Nwas bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:01.10,Default,Old Man,0000,0000,0000,,I just had them take a little nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:04.11,Default,Old Man,0000,0000,0000,,So, were you able to make sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.11,0:17:06.56,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It was definitely his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:11.10,Default,Old Man,0000,0000,0000,,So very strange. \NSomeone like that, helping humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:13.82,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,He's always been an odd one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:16.05,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,If you're that curious, go and see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:17.95,Default,Old Man,0000,0000,0000,,If the opportunity presents itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.70,Default,Old Man,0000,0000,0000,,I think we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:24.41,Default,Old Man,0000,0000,0000,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:27.14,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't one of them here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:30.07,Default,Old Man,0000,0000,0000,,We can leave this area to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:32.76,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, \Nyou don't want to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:37.50,Default,Old Man,0000,0000,0000,,The hunt will commence as planned. \NThat hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:49.39,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's not worth the extra trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:55.77,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Quite the stench, though. I can only imagine \Nthe fuss she'd make if she were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:09.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:12.75,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0000,0000,0000,,So, about the guild...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:15.86,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Chairman Go just gave his approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:19.22,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?! Then I'll get \Nright on finding us an office!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:20.15,DefaultItalics,Han Song-yi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.15,0:18:21.29,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0000,0000,0000,,Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:24.32,DefaultItalics,Han Song-yi,0000,0000,0000,,Jinwoo! Make sure you hire me, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:25.83,DefaultItalics,Han Song-yi,0000,0000,0000,,I promise I'll be useful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:27.80,DefaultItalicsTop,Yoo Jinho,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, we're discussing \Nsome very important—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:28.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:29.91,DefaultItalicsTop,Han Song-yi,0000,0000,0000,,Like what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:31.38,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Those two...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:35.30,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Man, I am seriously not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:39.83,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:42.14,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Sung. This is Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.14,0:18:44.45,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen with the guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:46.35,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm calling about something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:49.33,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Further down this highway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:52.31,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Correct. A B-Rank gate has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.31,0:18:53.77,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,That explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:56.00,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,Hunters are being arranged for,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:58.70,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0000,0000,0000,,but it's going to take some time \Nbefore they can get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:03.88,Default,Traffic Worker,0000,0000,0000,,One vehicle at a time, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:05.79,Default,Motorist,0000,0000,0000,,How much longer before the hunters get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.15,0:19:08.93,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,You mean the traffic's so bad \Nthe hunters can't make it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:10.53,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:12.34,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't hang up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:15.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to close the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:16.26,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.00,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,Manager Woo informed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:22.70,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,But it's going to be a while before \Nthe other hunters are able to make it—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:22.70,DefaultTop,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:23.99,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:27.82,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,There he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:30.39,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, I know it's only a B-Rank gate, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:35.08,Default,Associate,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.27,0:19:40.18,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this is obviously a red gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.43,0:19:43.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,How does this keep happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:47.71,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,The exit's closed, and I have no idea \Nhow far this forest extends...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:52.84,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Now I'm thinking I should've \Ntold Mom I was gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:59.59,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Then again, if this is all that's in here, \Nit shouldn't take that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:25.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Let's make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:34.98,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,He came to the memorial ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.77,0:20:41.19,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,This raid proved that \NI still have a lot to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:44.90,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't able to do anything. \NI had to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.77,0:20:48.41,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,But not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:51.95,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I want to catch up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:54.38,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I want to stand at his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.95,0:20:55.91,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,And to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.26,0:21:00.34,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I need to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:07.69,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Hunters are born to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:10.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Dungeons are worlds \Nwhere survival is all that matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:13.50,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,and a hunter has to be prepared \Nto become prey at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.49,0:21:18.56,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,That's because there's no telling \Nwhen the roles might be reversed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.15,0:21:21.68,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,You're always one step away from death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.29,0:21:25.08,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,But hunters are still willing to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:27.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,no matter how many enemies they face,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:30.85,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,or how much stronger those enemies might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:34.95,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,They've all got different \Nreasons for fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:36.91,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,To protect their family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.91,0:21:38.87,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,To uphold their ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:41.79,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,To prove who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:44.25,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,To defy fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:48.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,So hunters continue to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.03,0:21:53.64,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,And none of them are ready to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.43,0:22:17.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,On to the next target.
